# Design specs live here (see ../README.md).
#
# This file exists because git cannot track an empty directory. Seventeen spec
# numbers the ledger schedules -- 036-045 (video pipeline, 10 numbers) and
# 057-063 (core pages, 7 numbers) -- have no directory in this repository at
# all, and `git log --all --diff-filter=A -- specs/036*` returns nothing: they
# were folders only, so they never entered a commit. A .gitkeep is the whole
# fix.
#
# This said "Twenty-one" until the ranges were counted. 10 + 7 = 17; the two
# ranges are the whole list, and every one of the 17 is absent from specs/.
